This is a Poe.

3138
02:55:45,740 --> 02:55:46,740
Call the police!

3139
02:55:48,320 --> 02:55:48,960
On this...

3140
02:55:48,960 --> 02:55:49,600
MF-er.

3141
02:55:49,820 --> 02:55:50,920
Wait, that didn't heal us at all.

3142
02:55:55,190 --> 02:55:55,510
What?

3143
02:55:57,690 --> 02:55:58,570
That's a freaking lie!

3144
02:56:02,200 --> 02:56:03,400
I guess we eat this instead.

3145
02:56:04,800 --> 02:56:05,480
Yum, yum, yum, yum, yum.

3146
02:56:05,660 --> 02:56:06,540
Okay, now...

3147
02:56:06,540 --> 02:56:07,780
Uh, let's...

3148
02:56:07,780 --> 02:56:08,120
You know what?

3149
02:56:08,180 --> 02:56:08,600
How about...

3150
02:56:08,600 --> 02:56:08,860
Dude!

3151
02:56:10,040 --> 02:56:10,920
The bombs!

3152
02:56:13,140 --> 02:56:13,600
Suck!

3153
02:56:13,780 --> 02:56:13,980
Oh.

3154
02:56:15,820 --> 02:56:16,740
Actually, actually...

3155
02:56:21,640 --> 02:56:22,320
Not bad.

3156
02:56:24,660 --> 02:56:25,440
Ah, crap.

3157
02:56:32,060 --> 02:56:32,940
It's too fast.

3158
02:56:33,360 --> 02:56:34,140
Oh no, we're in the water!

3159
02:56:45,640 --> 02:56:46,440
Jump to here.

3160
02:56:49,620 --> 02:56:50,120
All right.

3161
02:56:50,360 --> 02:56:50,980
Focus now.

3162
02:56:51,120 --> 02:56:51,340
Focus.

3163
02:56:58,190 --> 02:56:58,610
I...

3164
02:56:58,610 --> 02:56:59,330
Oh, I actually got it!

3165
02:56:59,770 --> 02:57:00,150
No!

3166
02:57:10,580 --> 02:57:11,620
Oh, come here, you asshole!

3167
02:57:13,720 --> 02:57:14,580
What is it, Navi?

3168
02:57:15,980 --> 02:57:16,720
I understand.

3169
02:57:18,220 --> 02:57:19,000
It's what I'm doing.

3170
02:57:34,480 --> 02:57:35,500
Oh, it's so fast.

3171
02:57:35,660 --> 02:57:36,400
We hit it twice!

3172
02:57:36,960 --> 02:57:37,560
That's huge.

3173
02:58:06,550 --> 02:58:07,750
It's really well made.

3174
02:58:08,470 --> 02:58:09,930
Like, the effects on that boss.

3175
02:58:14,350 --> 02:58:15,470
Oh, all the water's gone.

3176
02:58:32,420 --> 02:58:33,160
By the way!

3177
02:58:35,040 --> 02:58:36,260
Where the hell is Mikushi?

3178
02:58:36,380 --> 02:58:37,220
Or whatever her name is.

3179
02:58:37,460 --> 02:58:38,400
I don't remember her name.

3180
02:58:40,180 --> 02:58:41,960
But, like, she disappeared in the very beginning.

3181
02:58:41,980 --> 02:58:43,160
I haven't seen from her since.

3182
02:59:00,340 --> 02:59:01,720
Chamber of the Sages.

3183
02:59:10,550 --> 02:59:11,530
There she is.

3184
02:59:15,340 --> 02:59:16,520
Looking like an alien.

3185
02:59:21,220 --> 02:59:24,640
I would have expected no less from the man I chose to be my husband.

3186
02:59:26,600 --> 02:59:27,040
Hey.

3187
02:59:28,320 --> 02:59:29,920
I also chose you, I guess, right?

3188
02:59:29,960 --> 02:59:30,780
It's not just you.

3189
02:59:32,160 --> 02:59:33,280
Actually, I didn't choose you.

3190
02:59:33,420 --> 02:59:34,980
Apparently I'm in this now, but whatever.

3191
02:59:35,620 --> 02:59:38,840
Sora's domain and its people will eventually return to their original state.

3192
02:59:39,060 --> 02:59:39,800
That's good.

3193
02:59:41,340 --> 02:59:44,420
As a reward, I grant my eternal love to you.

3194
02:59:45,360 --> 02:59:46,660
Ah, thank you.

3195
02:59:47,080 --> 02:59:50,500
And if all the people come back to Sora's domain, I can buy things from the shop again.

3196
02:59:50,960 --> 02:59:53,840
That was also something for 300 I needed to buy there, so that's great.

3197
02:59:55,400 --> 02:59:56,900
Well, that's what I want to say.

3198
02:59:57,280 --> 02:59:59,200
But I don't think I can offer that now.

3199
03:00:00,080 --> 03:00:00,300
Aw.

3200
03:00:01,120 --> 03:00:01,840
Too bad.

3201
03:00:03,040 --> 03:00:05,740
I have to guard the water temple as the Sage of Water.

3202
03:00:07,560 --> 03:00:08,280
And you.

3203
03:00:08,960 --> 03:00:10,820
You're searching for the Princess Zelda?

3204
03:00:11,800 --> 03:00:12,440
Ahem.

3205
03:00:12,860 --> 03:00:13,180
Yes.

3206
03:00:13,780 --> 03:00:14,000
Ha!

3207
03:00:14,240 --> 03:00:15,920
You can't hide anything from me!

3208
03:00:16,080 --> 03:00:16,280
Oh!

3209
03:00:18,560 --> 03:00:19,200
Sorry.

3210
03:00:20,400 --> 03:00:21,480
Princess Zelda.

3211
03:00:22,160 --> 03:00:23,180
She's alive.

3212
03:00:23,420 --> 03:00:24,660
I can sense it.

3213
03:00:25,140 --> 03:00:26,600
So don't be discouraged.

3214
03:00:29,220 --> 03:00:33,400
I can tell that nothing will stop you in your quest for justice and peace.

3215
03:00:34,020 --> 03:00:35,800
You must take this medallion.

3216
03:00:36,220 --> 03:00:37,520
Take it respectfully.

3217
03:00:43,460 --> 03:00:44,400
Oh, nice.

3218
03:00:44,540 --> 03:00:44,800
Tinitus.

3219
03:00:45,140 --> 03:00:45,600
Oh, nice.

3220
03:00:56,360 --> 03:00:58,280
You received the water medallion.

3221
03:00:59,180 --> 03:01:02,400
Ruto awakens as a sage and adds her power to yours.

3222
03:01:04,020 --> 03:01:08,460
Why do all my girlfriends become gods and inaccessible to me?

3223
03:01:08,900 --> 03:01:10,000
That's what I want to know.

3224
03:01:11,200 --> 03:01:13,740
It's like the universe is cockblocking me.

3225
03:01:14,920 --> 03:01:17,980
If you see Sheik, please give him my thanks, okay?

3226
03:01:18,620 --> 03:01:19,260
I will.

3227
03:01:33,490 --> 03:01:36,570
As the water rises, the evil is vanishing from the lake.

3228
03:01:37,270 --> 03:01:37,610
Link!

3229
03:01:38,050 --> 03:01:39,070
You did it!

3230
03:01:42,010 --> 03:01:42,950
Damn right I did.

3231
03:01:45,010 --> 03:01:47,750
Oh, he spoke to me before I was there, so I didn't actually hear it.

3232
03:01:47,950 --> 03:01:48,850
Sorry, can you say that again?

3233
03:01:51,230 --> 03:01:52,590
Did Ruto want to thank...

3234
03:01:52,590 --> 03:01:52,810
Oh!

3235
03:01:53,050 --> 03:01:53,630
That's the name.

3236
03:01:53,770 --> 03:01:54,610
Fucking Ruto.

3237
03:01:56,190 --> 03:01:57,110
What did I say?

3238
03:01:58,790 --> 03:01:59,750
Minxu or something?

3239
03:02:00,110 --> 03:02:01,370
Did Ruto want to thank me?

3240
03:02:02,490 --> 03:02:03,290
How did you know?

3241
03:02:03,630 --> 03:02:04,270
I see.

3242
03:02:05,010 --> 03:02:05,870
Yeah, you see a lot.

3243
03:02:06,590 --> 03:02:09,050
We have to return peace to Hyrule for her sake too.

3244
03:02:09,470 --> 03:02:10,110
Don't we?

3245
03:02:11,010 --> 03:02:12,230
What is this we business?

3246
03:02:12,370 --> 03:02:12,870
What have you done?

3247
03:02:14,110 --> 03:02:15,350
I'm the one doing things.

3248
03:02:16,330 --> 03:02:17,230
Look at that.

3249
03:02:17,410 --> 03:02:17,570
Link!

3250
03:02:18,870 --> 03:02:22,370
Together, you and Princess Ruto destroyed the evil monster.

3251
03:02:23,030 --> 03:02:23,850
I know!

3252
03:02:24,110 --> 03:02:24,850
Where were you?

3253
03:02:26,210 --> 03:02:28,970
Once again, the lake is filled with pure water.

3254
03:02:29,650 --> 03:02:31,210
All is as it was here.

3255
03:02:31,990 --> 03:02:32,670
That's good.

3256
03:02:34,750 --> 03:02:36,850
Restoring former balance here to nature.

3257
03:02:49,470 --> 03:02:50,250
Don't do it.

3258
03:02:50,490 --> 03:02:51,410
Don't do the thing.

3259
03:02:55,000 --> 03:02:56,720
Okay, he didn't do the thing at least.

3260
03:02:57,500 --> 03:02:58,800
Oh, he's up there!

3261
03:03:00,060 --> 03:03:01,000
Link, look up!

3262
03:03:08,770 --> 03:03:10,810
This guy has the weirdest exits!

3263
03:03:13,240 --> 03:03:14,760
What is he doing?

3264
03:03:15,680 --> 03:03:16,740
What is that?

3265
03:03:19,870 --> 03:03:22,670
Has a penchant for the dramatic, it seems.

3266
03:03:26,790 --> 03:03:29,250
At this point, he's just fucking with me.

3267
03:03:30,370 --> 03:03:31,790
What the hell, man?

3268
03:03:37,880 --> 03:03:39,620
Okay, so water is back.

3269
03:03:40,540 --> 03:03:43,500
And apparently, Sora's domain is good now, right?

3270
03:03:43,600 --> 03:03:44,380
What is...

3271
03:03:46,320 --> 03:03:47,660
Sorry, what is that?

3272
03:03:51,960 --> 03:03:52,440
Hello?

3273
03:04:02,870 --> 03:04:04,290
It's a diamond fish.

3274
03:04:16,740 --> 03:04:18,080
Oh, it's very far down.

3275
03:04:20,540 --> 03:04:21,600
Wow, that takes forever.

3276
03:04:27,720 --> 03:04:29,240
Oh, I'm too far down to hit it.

3277
03:04:30,940 --> 03:04:32,420
It's close, though, I think.

3278
03:04:34,060 --> 03:04:38,160
There's this epic illusion going on right now, where it looks like I'm actually floating down here, but I'm not.

3279
03:04:39,080 --> 03:04:39,520
You see that?

3280
03:04:41,720 --> 03:04:43,140
Maybe we gotta hit it with the arrow.

3281
03:04:45,640 --> 03:04:47,120
That would have to be done from land.

3282
03:04:50,370 --> 03:04:51,650
You can't shoot him down here.

3283
03:04:58,740 --> 03:05:00,240
Oh, what about this part down here?

3284
03:05:01,200 --> 03:05:02,480
That looks frozen to me.

3285
03:05:05,660 --> 03:05:06,500
Yeah, what the hell?

3286
03:05:10,270 --> 03:05:10,670
Uh.

3287
03:05:16,100 --> 03:05:17,440
Also want to become a child again.

3288
03:05:19,800 --> 03:05:21,080
Just to see what's up with that.

3289
03:05:23,620 --> 03:05:25,100
Anyway, uh, let's save the game.

3290
03:05:25,480 --> 03:05:26,580
Because that's it for now.

3291
03:05:28,020 --> 03:05:28,420
Uh.

3292
03:05:29,160 --> 03:05:29,840
There we go.

3293
03:05:32,020 --> 03:05:32,720
That's it.

3294
03:05:33,100 --> 03:05:36,100
For that 25, uh, ears.

3295
03:05:36,740 --> 03:05:38,300
That doesn't work in English, does it?

3296
03:05:40,460 --> 03:05:41,720
Isn't that what Disney says?

3297
03:05:41,880 --> 03:05:45,020
They say, that's all you get for this quarter or something, or penny?

3298
03:05:46,980 --> 03:05:48,040
I'm trying to translate.

3299
03:05:48,040 --> 03:05:50,900
I don't know what it says in English, but in Danish it's something like that.

3300
03:05:52,240 --> 03:05:53,700
Let's switch it over here.

3301
03:05:57,690 --> 03:05:58,130
Yeah!

3302
03:05:58,670 --> 03:06:00,070
What do you think about this, huh?

3303
03:06:01,450 --> 03:06:02,270
Water Temple.

3304
03:06:04,790 --> 03:06:07,270
That was a- Dude, that was a great dungeon, man.

3305
03:06:07,650 --> 03:06:09,810
I love the level design in this game.

3306
03:06:11,330 --> 03:06:16,410
I think I still prefer the Hidden Wall Temple, or whatever it's called.

3307
03:06:16,550 --> 03:06:17,370
The one in the well.

3308
03:06:17,970 --> 03:06:19,250
This one is a close second.

3309
03:06:22,030 --> 03:06:22,870
So nice.

3310
03:06:24,810 --> 03:06:25,910
You're the best!

3311
03:06:26,130 --> 03:06:26,430
Thanks!

3312
03:06:26,670 --> 03:06:27,430
Thank you, thank you.

3313
03:06:27,790 --> 03:06:28,290
Why, thank you.

3314
03:06:29,430 --> 03:06:30,770
Everyone hates the Water Temple?

3315
03:06:30,890 --> 03:06:31,070
What?

3316
03:06:31,230 --> 03:06:31,570
Wait, why?

3317
03:06:32,030 --> 03:06:33,170
I think it's great!

3318
03:06:35,350 --> 03:06:44,550
So many fun ways to go, like changing water levels, using the boots, complicated connections, fun puzzles.

3319
03:06:45,350 --> 03:06:46,390
I thought it was good.

3320
03:06:49,230 --> 03:06:51,210
Notorious for being the most confusing dungeon.

3321
03:06:51,390 --> 03:06:51,990
Wow, really?

3322
03:06:53,010 --> 03:06:55,410
Maybe I got lucky with some of the stuff I did then.

3323
03:07:00,400 --> 03:07:02,060
Oh yeah, opening the menu all the time?

3324
03:07:02,080 --> 03:07:03,160
It wasn't that bad, I guess.

3325
03:07:03,560 --> 03:07:05,180
I didn't actually think about that too much.

3326
03:07:06,780 --> 03:07:10,040
But yeah, they definitely need some kind of keybind for that to make it easier.

3327
03:07:13,060 --> 03:07:14,400
You didn't say for hell once?

3328
03:07:15,180 --> 03:07:15,560
Yeah!

3329
03:07:16,120 --> 03:07:17,760
I wasn't too distressed today.

3330
03:07:19,900 --> 03:07:20,640
It was okay.

3331
03:07:23,020 --> 03:07:23,740
Hold on.

3332
03:07:28,300 --> 03:07:30,000
We gotta put on some music here.

3333
03:07:32,480 --> 03:07:34,040
Some N64 music.

3334
03:07:36,060 --> 03:07:36,600
Yeah.

3335
03:07:40,480 --> 03:07:41,900
Medicine man moment.

3336
03:07:42,080 --> 03:07:43,520
Yeah, what's up with the camera?

3337
03:07:44,020 --> 03:07:45,140
That made me sick.

3338
03:07:45,240 --> 03:07:46,580
It was like, up and down.

3339
03:07:46,660 --> 03:07:47,060
Mikushi.

3340
03:07:49,180 --> 03:07:50,760
Yeah, no, it's Rudo.

3341
03:07:52,280 --> 03:07:52,820
Dumbass.

3342
03:07:53,120 --> 03:07:53,860
Get it right.

3343
03:07:55,760 --> 03:07:57,160
The demon wobble?

3344
03:07:57,640 --> 03:07:59,080
Yeah, I guess you could say that.

3345
03:08:01,020 --> 03:08:03,720
You can get softlocked if you use keys in the wrong order.

3346
03:08:03,860 --> 03:08:04,280
Oh!

3347
03:08:07,060 --> 03:08:08,040
What do you do then?

3348
03:08:09,320 --> 03:08:10,000
Is the...

3349
03:08:10,000 --> 03:08:10,480
Is the...

3350
03:08:10,480 --> 03:08:10,820
What?

3351
03:08:10,980 --> 03:08:11,240
Really?

3352
03:08:11,360 --> 03:08:12,800
Can you actually get softlocked?

3353
03:08:14,700 --> 03:08:17,040
That's a horrible design oversight if that's the case.

3354
03:08:20,000 --> 03:08:21,000
Oh, it's not real?

3355
03:08:21,180 --> 03:08:21,700
Wait, what?

3356
03:08:23,860 --> 03:08:24,640
It's a rumor?

3357
03:08:26,120 --> 03:08:28,460
Okay, I guess I fell for the rumor.

3358
03:08:30,040 --> 03:08:31,440
The softlock is a myth.

3359
03:08:32,400 --> 03:08:34,620
I mean, I would find a way to get softlocked.

3360
03:08:35,960 --> 03:08:36,400
Trust.

3361
03:08:40,810 --> 03:08:42,390
Did you guys make predictions today?

3362
03:08:42,410 --> 03:08:42,930
I wanna see.

3363
03:08:43,890 --> 03:08:45,970
Oh, you had a first death doesn't count thing?

3364
03:08:46,770 --> 03:08:47,690
Will he drown?

3365
03:08:48,030 --> 03:08:48,270
Okay.

3366
03:08:49,590 --> 03:08:50,110
Did I drown?

3367
03:08:51,850 --> 03:08:53,570
I think I drowned once, didn't I?

3368
03:08:55,010 --> 03:08:56,490
Yeah, at one point I drowned.

3369
03:08:56,590 --> 03:08:59,630
I remember that it was horrible watching him run out of air.

3370
03:09:05,600 --> 03:09:06,700
That was a...

3371
03:09:06,700 --> 03:09:08,440
Man, I love these dungeons.

3372
03:09:14,200 --> 03:09:16,200
Dude, Dark Link, that was awesome.

3373
03:09:16,300 --> 03:09:17,480
I love the arena.

3374
03:09:18,080 --> 03:09:21,720
With the tree in the center and the reflection, it was very...

3375
03:09:22,540 --> 03:09:23,640
What do you call it?

3376
03:09:24,180 --> 03:09:27,760
Yeah, like I said, it was like a Dali painting, right?

3377
03:09:27,820 --> 03:09:31,780
It was very obscure, bizarre, but also beautiful.

3378
03:09:32,140 --> 03:09:33,080
Surreal, that's the...

3379
03:09:33,080 --> 03:09:34,020
Yes, that's it, surreal.

3380
03:09:34,540 --> 03:09:35,080
Thank you.

3381
03:09:35,260 --> 03:09:36,260
That's the word I was looking for.

3382
03:09:37,920 --> 03:09:39,100
Dark Link, epic battle.

3383
03:09:39,180 --> 03:09:40,220
It was an epic battle.

3384
03:09:42,680 --> 03:09:47,520
And it's so cool when you think about it, Dark Link could be seen as the reflection of me, right?

3385
03:09:47,640 --> 03:09:47,920
My...

3386
03:09:47,920 --> 03:09:49,080
Like, my own dark side.

3387
03:09:49,980 --> 03:09:50,680
Or something...

3388
03:09:50,680 --> 03:09:51,620
Something like that.

3389
03:09:52,360 --> 03:09:55,020
It took me so long for Dark Link, I never thought to use the hammer.

3390
03:09:55,160 --> 03:09:55,700
Oh, okay.

3391
03:09:57,180 --> 03:09:57,880
Yeah, he's...

3392
03:09:57,880 --> 03:09:59,720
He's parrying everything when you use the sword.

3393
03:10:00,400 --> 03:10:01,740
I didn't try the bombs, though.

3394
03:10:01,780 --> 03:10:02,600
I will say that.

3395
03:10:03,040 --> 03:10:05,540
I think even Dark Link doesn't have anything against bombs.

3396
03:10:10,320 --> 03:10:10,760
Yeah.

3397
03:10:13,520 --> 03:10:16,760
You could have done Water Temple before fire, and you wouldn't have the hammer.

3398
03:10:17,160 --> 03:10:18,820
I guess I would have to use bombs, then.

3399
03:10:20,880 --> 03:10:23,260
I mean, there must be another way other than the hammer.

3400
03:10:23,760 --> 03:10:24,860
If you can do it first.

3401
03:10:26,520 --> 03:10:27,400
Otherwise, that's...

3402
03:10:28,120 --> 03:10:28,940
really confusing.

3403
03:10:34,400 --> 03:10:35,480
I'm saving the salt.

3404
03:10:35,480 --> 03:10:35,720
But...

3405
03:10:35,720 --> 03:10:39,040
Yeah, I guess you must have won a lot, then, if you got both right.

3406
03:10:40,700 --> 03:10:42,020
We love the magic trick.

3407
03:10:42,140 --> 03:10:42,840
Disappearing block.

3408
03:10:43,740 --> 03:10:45,100
Wait, what disappearing block?

3409
